  "details": "When reporting an avatar, the tooltip of \"Sexual Content\" says \"suggestive material\", but the callout/explainer in the page that follows says \"explicit content\" and never makes a mention of suggestive content as a callout to report. This may create confusion or not be in line with the [Creator Guidelines](https://hello.vrchat.com/creator-guidelines).\n\nExpected result: \"explicit material\"?\n\nActual result: \"suggestive material\"\n\nAdditional info: The tooltip has had the \"suggestive content\" label even before the latest VRChat 2026.2.3 (OPEN BETA) `Build 1860` which introduced the callouts.",
